# App menu "Sync now": empty pending queue -> NO --push-pending, just --mirror-catalog with
# the honest engine-driven progress panel; success stamps last-sync.txt and shows the real
# MIRROR summary line.
desc app menu: Sync now -> --mirror-catalog only (queue empty), honest summary
invoke app
config paired
wifi up
engine 0|MIRROR created=5 updated=2\nRESULT ok
pick 0
pick 255
expect_exit 0
expect_trace PROMPT[Lodor]
expect_trace Sync now|Refresh library|Download a game|Pull saves from server|Recent activity|Settings ▸
expect_trace ENGINE --mirror-catalog
expect_trace_absent ENGINE --push-pending
expect_trace PANEL mode=auto title='Sync complete'
expect_trace MIRROR created=5
expect_file App/LodorSync/data/last-sync.txt
